Rejects a GeoJSON geometry whose type is not a string, a point coordinate that
is not a number, and a MultiLineString line that is not an array, instead of
reading each value as that type. A type of 1, null, true, or [] crashed the
conversion with libc++, whether the GeoJSON came from a host, a style, or a
source URL (https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1434).
Upstream: not proposed; MapLibre Native vendors the archived mapbox/geojson-cpp

